title: "Three-uniform Berge-C5 saturation: a two-thirds upper bound, the cone spectrum and exact small values"
authors:
  - family-names: Goyal
    given-names: Dev D.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-9132-744X"
date-released: 2026-10-31
